Z||000000||Homicidal||02-27-2001||07:56 PM||||Hell yah, they sound AWESOME!<P>I laughed out loud when I saw the dinky little magnet on the stock 4X10's.  Couldn't pickup a pin!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Accompanied with my 10" sub in the front trunk, JVC 12 CD Changer + Headunit, 300W amp, and now these, I got a bonafide sound system! <P>Easy removal, easy install, and now, easier driving!<P>Congrats to me!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Homicidal (edited 02-27-2001).]||||reg||10
